@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "FAQ | Low JianKhai";
}

<h1>FAQ</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Common questions and quick answers.</p>

<section class="accordion" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
    <details class="accordion-item" open>
        <summary><span>Hi, Why do you create this site?</span></summary>
        <p>
            Hi!!!! (≧◡≦)
        </p>
        <p>
            As a software engineer, I believe having a personal website is more important than ever, especially in the AI era.
        </p>
        <p>
            I come from an unconventional background, having spent four years in networking before transitioning into software engineering. Because of that, my resume only shows a few years of software engineering experience, and I don't think it does me justice.
        </p>
        <p>
            I've found that people often judge a developer by the number of years on their resume. Sometimes, they even question the fundamentals behind those numbers. I wanted a place where my work could speak louder than my resume.
        </p>
        <p>
            That's why I built this website. It's one of my first major long-term projects, where I can showcase not only what I've built, but also how I think, the architectural decisions I make, and how I solve technical problems.
        </p>
        <p>
            I hope this website gives you a better understanding of what I'm capable of as a software engineer. (≧◡≦)
        </p>
    </details>
    <details class="accordion-item">
        <summary><span>Can I see your design notes?</span></summary>
        <p>
            Sure! I keep a public document where I casually jot down ideas, progress,
            random thoughts, lessons learned, and plans while building this website and
            other personal projects. Think of it as a developer diary rather than formal
            documentation.
        </p>
        <p>
            <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1iouwZR0nijSWI1xR_CDOWl-o7_WesBY2ObQwu_3bfCM/edit?tab=t.0"
                   target="_blank"
                   rel="noopener noreferrer">
                Open the design notes
            </a>
        </p>

        <p>
            Also my
            <a href="https://inamilanzhu.wordpress.com/"
                   target="_blank"
                   rel="noopener noreferrer">
                personal blog
            </a>
            for ranting!
        </p>
    </details>
</section>
